+	Orders -> modes (SPEC-ARMY-FINAL §6.1): FOLLOW (automatic) = GUARD at HOME (via RETURN), FOLLOW when OUT; a GUARD
+	order = RETURN -> GUARD even while he is out, and turns back into automatic FOLLOW at his next HOME (an old client's
